sequenceDiagram
    participant Employee as Employee
    participant WebApp as Web Application
    participant LeaveAPI as Leave API
    participant LeaveSvc as Leave Service
    participant EmployeeSvc as Employee Service
    participant NotificationSvc as Notification Service
    participant DB as Database
    participant Manager as Manager

    Employee->>WebApp: Submit Leave Request
    WebApp->>LeaveAPI: POST /api/leave-requests
    LeaveAPI->>LeaveSvc: createLeaveRequest(employeeId, dates, type)
    LeaveSvc->>EmployeeSvc: getManager(employeeId)
    EmployeeSvc-->>LeaveSvc: managerId
    LeaveSvc->>DB: saveLeaveRequest(leaveRequest)
    DB-->>LeaveSvc: leaveRequestSaved
    LeaveSvc->>NotificationSvc: notifyManager(managerId, "New Leave Request")
    LeaveSvc-->>LeaveAPI: requestCreated
    LeaveAPI-->>WebApp: 201 Created
    WebApp-->>Employee: Leave Request Submitted

    Manager->>WebApp: Approve Leave Request
    WebApp->>LeaveAPI: PATCH /api/leave-requests/{id}/approve
    LeaveAPI->>LeaveSvc: approveLeaveRequest(requestId)
    LeaveSvc->>DB: updateLeaveRequestStatus(requestId, "APPROVED")
    DB-->>LeaveSvc: statusUpdated
    LeaveSvc->>NotificationSvc: notifyEmployee(employeeId, "Leave Approved")
    LeaveSvc-->>LeaveAPI: requestApproved
    LeaveAPI-->>WebApp: 200 OK
    WebApp-->>Manager: Leave Approved
